            <ArticleTitle>Erythema multiforme-like generalized allergic contact dermatitis caused by Alpinia galanga.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>118-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study reports a case of localized contact dermatitis and subsequently generalized erythema multiforme-like eruptions after topical application of herbal remedies. Patch tests showed there was an allergen in fresh and dried Alpinia galanga, which is also a popular spice in Southeast Asian cuisines.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
